    "title": "Jujutsu Kaisen - Itadori Yuuji (X-Ray Markings)",
    "description": "Jujutsu Kaisen - Itadori Yuuji\r\nThe art is taken from the opening of the anime and retraced quite a bit for a higher resolution/quality.\r\n\r\n\r\n[list][h1]Features:[/h1]\r\n[*]X-Ray on Markings\r\n[*]3D Clock\r\n[*]Audio Visualizer\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n\r\n『  Disclaimer  』\r\nAll Jujutsu Kaisen art is credited to their respective owner, MAPPA Studio.  I don't own any of the art, I just edited it a little and used it to animate the wallpaper for fun.  If needed, I can remove it.\r\n\r\n[img]http://i.imgur.com/pCWV5rX.png[/img]\r\n\r\nIf you liked it, rate it 5 stars.\r\n[img]http://i.imgur.com/Wf3GCHE.png[/img]\r\n\r\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/eesbad/myworkshopfiles/?appid=431960][img]http://i.imgur.com/82a3yNw.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n『 Changelog 』\r\nNov. 13:\r\n+ Updated so that you can toggle on/off the 3D clock, Audio Visualizer, X-Ray in the properties!\r\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/6Gk5lNj.png[/img]\r\nNov. 28:\r\n+ Added toggle on/off for sun rays\r\n+ Fixed ends of hair on electric cable lines\r\n+ Reduced active texture memory to 325, used to be 388\r\n- Not much can be done for the memory, since the X-Ray takes a lot.\r\n- Toggling off some of the features if it lags can possibly help.",
